{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"2dbc874a-1d5d-406e-825f-838029f2f0c5","title":"Colosseum Crypto World's Fair Hackathon | Superteam Kazakhstan Track","slug":"colosseum-crypto-worlds-fair-hackathon-superteam-kazakhstan-track","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Superteam Kazakhstan\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuperteam Kazakhstan\u003c/strong\u003e is the local hub of the global Superteam network. We support builders, founders, developers, and contributors across Kazakhstan as they learn, build, connect, and grow.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThrough hackathons, education, mentorship, community programs, and global ecosystem opportunities, we help local talent turn ambitious ideas into working products.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYour Road to Colosseum Starts Here — Kazakhstan Side Track\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eSuperteam Kazakhstan Side Track\u003c/strong\u003e is a local builder program connected to the \u003cstrong\u003eColosseum Global Hackathon\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eOur goal is to help teams move from an idea to a working product, prepare a strong submission, receive expert feedback, and compete on the global Colosseum stage.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eParticipants will get access to:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExpert Mentorship:\u003c/strong\u003e Receive feedback from experienced founders, developers, investors, and Solana ecosystem contributors.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilder Workshops:\u003c/strong\u003e Join practical sessions covering product development, technical architecture, user validation, go-to-market strategy, pitching, and demo preparation.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubmission Support:\u003c/strong\u003e Prepare every required part of your Colosseum application before the deadline.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDemo Day:\u003c/strong\u003e Present your product, receive feedback from judges, and demonstrate what your team has built.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEcosystem Connections:\u003c/strong\u003e Meet other builders, mentors, partners, and potential collaborators from Kazakhstan and the wider Solana ecosystem.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eHackathon Track Scope\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWe are especially interested in projects from the following categories:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eGaming\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eDePIN\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eConsumer Apps\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eAI Platforms / Agents\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003ePayments \u0026amp; Remittance\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThese categories are priorities, not restrictions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYou may build in any category available on Colosseum. We welcome creative ideas that solve real problems, provide clear user value, and use blockchain technology meaningfully.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWe are particularly interested in projects with:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003ea clearly defined problem and target audience;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003ea working product or convincing prototype;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003ethoughtful technical execution;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003ea realistic go-to-market plan;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eearly user validation or traction, where available;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003ea strong and committed founding team.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eTo participate in the Superteam Kazakhstan Side Track, your team must:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eMeet the\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.colosseum.org/hackathon#faqs\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eofficial eligibility requirements\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e of the Colosseum Global Hackathon.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eRegister on the\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eColosseum platform\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e and submit your project to the current global hackathon.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eComplete all required sections of the Colosseum application:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProject Details\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMedia and Code\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTeam Profiles\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eProvide a direct link to the project’s GitHub repository.\u003cbr\u003eThe link must lead to a specific repository, not a user profile or organization. Judges must be able to access the submitted code.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSubmit a product demo video.\u003cbr\u003eThe video must be hosted on YouTube, Loom, or Vimeo, last no longer than three minutes, and show the working product. A slide deck or code walkthrough does not count as a product demo.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSubmit a separate pitch video.\u003cbr\u003eThe video must be hosted on YouTube, Loom, or Vimeo and last no longer than two minutes. Introduce your team, explain what you are building, and tell us why your team is suited to build it.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eEnsure every team member completes their individual Colosseum submission profile.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003ePass Colosseum’s initial application review.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eIncomplete Colosseum applications, inaccessible repositories, missing videos, or unfinished team profiles will not be eligible for the Kazakhstan Side Track.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJudging Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eProjects will be evaluated using the following criteria:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProblem and User Value:\u003c/strong\u003e Does the project solve a meaningful problem for a clearly defined audience?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Execution:\u003c/strong\u003e Is there a functional and convincing product or prototype?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Quality:\u003c/strong\u003e Is the implementation thoughtful, reliable, and appropriate for the product?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEcosystem Impact:\u003c/strong\u003e Can the project create meaningful value for the Solana or broader blockchain ecosystem?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMarket Potential:\u003c/strong\u003e Is there a credible path to users, adoption, or sustainable growth?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInnovation:\u003c/strong\u003e Does the project introduce a creative idea, approach, or user experience?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTeam Strength:\u003c/strong\u003e Does the team have the relevant experience, commitment, and ability to continue building?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePitch and Demo Quality:\u003c/strong\u003e Does the submission clearly explain and demonstrate the product?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrizes \u0026amp; Builder Support\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThe Superteam Kazakhstan Side Track features a \u003cstrong\u003e$5,000 USDC prize pool\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e🥇 \u003cstrong\u003eFirst Prize:\u003c/strong\u003e $2,000 USDC\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e🥈 \u003cstrong\u003eSecond Prize:\u003c/strong\u003e $1,200 USDC\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e🥉 \u003cstrong\u003eThird Prize:\u003c/strong\u003e $800 USDC\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFourth Prize:\u003c/strong\u003e $500 USDC (best student team)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFifth Prize:\u003c/strong\u003e $300 USDC (best first-time team)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSixth Prize:\u003c/strong\u003e $200 USDC (the best idea)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSelected teams will also receive mentorship, submission feedback, and access to the wider Superteam and Solana builder ecosystem.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRegistration deadline:\u003c/strong\u003e 8 October\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProgram dates:\u003c/strong\u003e 15 September - 8 October\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDemo Day:\u003c/strong\u003e 10 October\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColosseum submission deadline:\u003c/strong\u003e 12 October\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResources\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eColosseum Platform\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003e\u003cspa